{"text": " Vintre toate zonele din Bucure\u0219ti, una mi-a atrat saten\u021bia \u00een mod special. Fabrica de Glucoz\u0103. Aici s-au adunat cei mai tare dezvoltatori comisione comun\u0103. S\u0103 creze ora\u0219ul de 15 minute. Ce \u00eenseamn\u0103 asta? C\u0103 aici se construiesc \u0219coli, magazinii, viserici, piloturi \u0219i locuin\u021be de top. \u0218i toate la 15 minute. De mers pe jos. Iar acum, f\u0103r\u0103 s\u0103 dau nume, am s\u0103 v\u0103 ar\u0103t c\u00e2teva din cl\u0103dirile care se ridic aici. Iar dac\u0103 ar trebui s\u0103 discut\u0103m despre interioare, ai mai bine s\u0103 v\u0103 ar\u0103t. Iar dac\u0103 te g\u00e2ndesc a ghi\u021bionezi un imobil aici, Nord Bucure\u0219ti este solu\u021bia.", "segments": [{"id": 0, "seek": 0, "start": 0.0, "end": 3.92, "text": " Vintre toate zonele din Bucure\u0219ti, una mi-a atrat saten\u021bia \u00een mod special.", "tokens": [50364, 691, 686, 265, 281, 473, 6668, 306, 3791, 363, 1311, 540, 10355, 7317, 11, 2002, 2752, 12, 64, 412, 4481, 3227, 268, 15918, 654, 15351, 1072, 2121, 13, 50560], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3406553968871381, "compression_ratio": 1.4474576271186441, "no_speech_prob": 0.03912042826414108}, {"id": 1, "seek": 0, "start": 5.64, "end": 6.84, "text": " Fabrica de Glucoz\u0103.", "tokens": [50646, 479, 455, 15192, 368, 460, 2781, 1291, 89, 4089, 13, 50706], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3406553968871381, "compression_ratio": 1.4474576271186441, "no_speech_prob": 0.03912042826414108}, {"id": 2, "seek": 0, "start": 6.84, "end": 10.44, "text": " Aici s-au adunat cei mai tare dezvoltatori comisione comun\u0103.", "tokens": [50706, 316, 8787, 262, 12, 1459, 614, 409, 267, 1769, 72, 12698, 49423, 45057, 47610, 39842, 395, 1991, 68, 11040, 4089, 13, 50886], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.3406553968871381, "compression_ratio": 1.4474576271186441, "no_speech_prob": 0.03912042826414108}, {"id": 3, "seek": 0, "start": 10.44, "end": 13.0, "text": " S\u0103 creze o